<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:48:34 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>物理学家声称人工智能可以发现人类无法访问的智能形式</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-could-discover-forms-of-intelligence-humans-cant-access-physicist-claims</link><description>人工智能不仅仅会模仿人类的思维。他说，它可以访问我们周围存在的“通用”来源。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-could-discover-forms-of-intelligence-humans-cant-access-physicist-claims.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:48:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/ai-could-discover-forms-of-intelligence-humans-cant-access-physicist-claims</guid></item><item><title>这是道德。不是技术道德</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/its-ethics-not-tech-ethics</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/its-ethics-not-tech-ethics2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:33:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/its-ethics-not-tech-ethics</guid></item><item><title>科塔最佳 JEE 教练 — 获得顶级 AIR 排名</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/best-jee-coaching-in-kota-get-top-air-ranks</link><description>为有志于工程的人提供专家指导、优质学习材料和综合测试系列。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/best-jee-coaching-in-kota-get-top-air-ranks2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:18:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/best-jee-coaching-in-kota-get-top-air-ranks</guid></item><item><title>9 月 17 日，星期四</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/thursday-september-17th</link><description>该网站展示了《联邦公报》“Web 2.0”版本的原型。它不是《联邦公报》的官方法律版本，也不能取代 GPO govinfo.gov 上的官方印刷版或官方电子版。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 15:03:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/thursday-september-17th</guid></item><item><title>绕过热驱动退磁的速度限制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/bypassing-the-speed-limit-for-thermally-driven-demagnetization</link><description>与预期相反，铁磁体的磁化动力学可以通过升高温度、激光激励或磁场来加速——这种行为为高速自旋电子学带来了希望。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bypassing-the-speed-limit-for-thermally-driven-demagnetization2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:48:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/bypassing-the-speed-limit-for-thermally-driven-demagnetization</guid></item><item><title>如何同步长距离量子网络</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-to-synchronize-a-long-distance-quantum-network</link><description>研究人员展示了一种新的量子存储设备，该设备将使网络中的远程节点能够及时协调，这是未来量子互联网的关键要素。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/how-to-synchronize-a-long-distance-quantum-network2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:33:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/how-to-synchronize-a-long-distance-quantum-network</guid></item><item><title>稳定的额叶信号，灵活的海马信号：大脑如何在目标改变时保留背景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stable-frontal-signals-flexible-hippocampal-ones-how-the-brain-preserves-context-as-goals-change</link><description>当人类完成一项任务时，他们可以暂时将信息存储在脑海中，同时根据不断变化的情况对其进行操作和调整。为了支持这种被称为工作记忆的能力，大脑需要保留有关任务的重要背景，并在规则、目标或环境发生变化时更新它。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/stable-frontal-signals-flexible-hippocampal-ones-how-the-brain-preserves-context-as-goals-change3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:18:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/stable-frontal-signals-flexible-hippocampal-ones-how-the-brain-preserves-context-as-goals-change</guid></item><item><title>新的模拟将异常的粒子扩散与软堵塞物质的屈服联系起来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/new-simulations-link-unusual-particle-diffusion-to-yielding-in-soft-jammed-matter</link><description>与普通固体或液体相比，胶体悬浮液、乳液、泡沫和凝胶等软材料通常表现出复杂且不寻常的行为。例如，从机械角度来看，它们可以像固体一样抵抗变形，但当施加足够强的外部驱动时，它们也可以像液体一样开始流动。这种从类固体到类液体行为的转变（称为“屈服”）是软非晶材料物理学以及许多工业和生物过程的核心。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-simulations-link-unusual-particle-diffusion-to-yielding-in-soft-jammed-matter2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 14:03:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/new-simulations-link-unusual-particle-diffusion-to-yielding-in-soft-jammed-matter</guid></item><item><title>双重发现揭示了如何控制等离子体纳米激光器的相干性</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/dual-findings-reveal-how-to-control-coherence-in-plasmonic-nanolasers</link><description>东芬兰大学的研究人员发现了两种控制相干性的互补机制，这些机制由纳入光学增益材料（也称为等离子体晶格激光器）的金属纳米粒子阵列组成。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dual-findings-reveal-how-to-control-coherence-in-plasmonic-nanolasers.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:48:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/dual-findings-reveal-how-to-control-coherence-in-plasmonic-nanolasers</guid></item><item><title>滑动液滴指向移动离子之外的充电机制</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/sliding-droplets-point-to-charging-mechanism-beyond-mobile-ions</link><description>无论是在家里的窗玻璃上还是在计算机芯片的工业清洁过程中：在固体表面上滑动的液滴都会带电。然而，这种充电背后的物理机制仍然是一个争论的话题。这种充电通常归因于液滴和表面之间界面处带电粒子（离子）的交换。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/sliding-droplets-point-to-charging-mechanism-beyond-mobile-ions3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:33:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/sliding-droplets-point-to-charging-mechanism-beyond-mobile-ions</guid></item></channel></rss>